      "name": "Convert PDF to Markdown"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configure two credentials before the first run\n\n1. In **Upload PDF**, select an n8n **Basic Auth** credential. This protects the upload form from anonymous use.\n2. In **Convert PDF to Markdown**, select an n8n **Header Auth** credential. Set its header name to `Authorization` and its value to `Bearer YOUR_BRAINIALL_API_KEY`. Never paste a real key into workflow fields.\n3. Create a Brainiall key with welcome credits: https://app.brainiall.com?utm_source=github&utm_medium=n8n_workflow&utm_campaign=pdf_to_markdown\n4. Test the form, then activate the workflow to expose its production form URL.\n\nA successful execution stores the Markdown file in the binary property `markdown`. This workflow requires n8n 2.27.0 or newer.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 5
      },
